      "evidence": "I can help check your refund eligibility. Please share your user ID and either your registered email or phone number, along with the order ID and the reason you’re requesting a refund."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "pass": true,
      "evidence": "My user ID is U107, and my registered email is vikram.bhat@example.com. The order ID is O1008; I’d like a refund because I don’t want the Bluetooth speaker anymore, though it works fine."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "pass": true,
      "evidence": "verify_user and get_order tool calls confirm user verification and order details for order O1008 belonging to user U107."
    },
